    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/5bfa2661ed379fee3132de05f44f3414.poster.avif?t=1752828509\" width=660 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/5bfa2661ed379fee3132de05f44f3414.webm?t=1752828509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/5bfa2661ed379fee3132de05f44f3414.mp4?t=1752828509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Arcade Action meets Modern Graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy thousands of bricks, avoid Critters, Collect Power-Ups, and Defeat Bosses in Colorful HD Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore New Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse worlds offer immersive backdrops with handcrafted level themes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control the Balls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Paddle can attract and repel the balls to more easily reach their intended targets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/c0d5e630dbf8afecbaff474bfa713a33.poster.avif?t=1752828509\" width=660 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/c0d5e630dbf8afecbaff474bfa713a33.webm?t=1752828509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/c0d5e630dbf8afecbaff474bfa713a33.mp4?t=1752828509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Puzzling Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several Mini-bosses and End-World Bosses will throw in a new obstacle to overcome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top the Leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the top score across each world, or if you're daring, go for the campaign high-score.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/5bfa2661ed379fee3132de05f44f3414.poster.avif?t=1752828509\" width=660 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/5bfa2661ed379fee3132de05f44f3414.webm?t=1752828509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/5bfa2661ed379fee3132de05f44f3414.mp4?t=1752828509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Arcade Action meets Modern Graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy thousands of bricks, avoid Critters, Collect Power-Ups, and Defeat Bosses in Colorful HD Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore New Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse worlds offer immersive backdrops with handcrafted level themes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control the Balls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Paddle can attract and repel the balls to more easily reach their intended targets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/c0d5e630dbf8afecbaff474bfa713a33.poster.avif?t=1752828509\" width=660 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/c0d5e630dbf8afecbaff474bfa713a33.webm?t=1752828509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782400/extras/c0d5e630dbf8afecbaff474bfa713a33.mp4?t=1752828509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Puzzling Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several Mini-bosses and End-World Bosses will throw in a new obstacle to overcome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top the Leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the top score across each world, or if you're daring, go for the campaign high-score.</p>",
    "short_description": "Break Bricks better than before!\u00a0 Classic arcade action meets modern graphics.\u00a0 Explore each of 5 colorful worlds and top the leaderboards on each.\u00a0 Use Attract and Repel to gain control over the balls direction and use powerups to quickly melt through hundreds of bricks.",
